{title: Jab Jab Teri Surat Dekhun}
{artist: Janbaaz Kalyanji Anandji}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Jaan-e-jaana [E]oh jaan-e-jaana
[E]Ho jab jab teri surat dekhun
[E]Jab jab teri surat dekhun
[Am]Pyar sa [E]dil mein jaage
[E]Ho teri tarafhi dil mujhe khinche
[B]Kya [C]tu [Am]mera laage
[Am]Kya tu [E]mera laage
[E]Kaun sa yeh bandhan hai
[E]Yeh kaisa apnapan hai
[E]Kisi ka [Am]zor chale na
[Am]Yeh kaisi dil [E]ki lagan hai
[D]Jaan-e-jaana [E]oh jaan-e-jaana
[E]Dilbar tujhse milte milte
[E]Dilbar tujhse milte milte
[Am]Main bhi [E]aurat ban gayi
[E]ho toone mujhe anmol banaya
[B]Main [C]mohabbat [Am]ban gayi
[Am]Main mohabbat [E]ban gayi
[E]Deewanon ka mausam hai
[E]Ke sholon pe shabnam hai
[E]Mera dil [Am]toot na jaaye
[Am]Tujhe yeh dil [E]ki kasam hai
[D]Jaan-e-jana [E]o jaan-e-jana
[E]Phool bankar tera chehra
[E]Mere haathon mein khila hai
[Am]Milan hai dil se dil ka
[E]Badan se badan mila hai
[E]Teri chaahat ki garmi
[E]Naram saanson ka toofan
[E]Mom ho [Am]gaya mera dil
[Am]Pighalne laga [E]hai imaan
[D]Jaan-e-jana [Am]o [E]jaan-e-jana
